{'symbol': 'CME', 'date': '2022-12-13 16:49:00', 'title': "CME GROUP NAMED TO COMPUTERWORLD'S 2023 LIST OF BEST PLACES TO WORK IN IT", 'text': "CHICAGO , DEC. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CME GROUP, THE WORLD'S LEADING DERIVATIVES MARKETPLACE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED BY FOUNDRY'S COMPUTERWORLD AS ONE OF THE BEST PLACES TO WORK IN IT – FOR THE FIFTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR. THE BEST PLACES TO WORK IN IT IS AN ANNUAL RANKING OF WORK ENVIRONMENTS FOR TECHNOLOGY PROFESSIONALS BY COMPUTERWORLD."}